mlxflow 0.8
1. Read CSV              sales.csv
2. Chart                 kind=bar; x=month; y=sales
3. Save Image            sales-chart.png

4. Table to Text   (1)   format=markdown
5. Summarize             Ministral 3B; "two sentences: the overall trend,
                         then the best and the worst month"
6. Save Text             sales-summary.txt
